  "Combined with AI assistants, anyone \u2014 from hardware engineers to young beginners \u2014 can describe their idea, get the code, and run it instantly inside SoifGo without dealing with complex native Android development.": "Yapay zeka asistanlar\u0131yla birle\u015fti\u011finde, donan\u0131m m\u00fchendislerinden gen\u00e7 yeni ba\u015flayanlara kadar herkes fikrini tan\u0131mlayabilir, kodu alabilir ve karma\u015f\u0131k yerel Android geli\u015ftirmeyle u\u011fra\u015fmadan an\u0131nda SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilir.",
