  "A happy accident: in French,": "Mutlu bir tesad\u00fcf: Frans\u0131zca'da,",
  "means \u201cthirst\u201d \u2014 a thirst to build.": "\u201csusuzluk\u201d anlam\u0131na gelir \u2014 in\u015fa etme susuzlu\u011fu.",
