  "What is SoifGo?": "SoifGo nedir?",
  "SoifGo is an Android-based hardware control and application platform designed for makers, embedded developers, students, engineers and IoT builders.": "SoifGo; \u00fcreticiler, g\u00f6m\u00fcl\u00fc geli\u015ftiriciler, \u00f6\u011frenciler, m\u00fchendisler ve IoT geli\u015ftiricileri i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015f, Android tabanl\u0131 bir donan\u0131m kontrol ve uygulama platformudur.",
  "Instead of creating a complete native Android application, users can build interfaces with HTML, CSS and JavaScript and run them directly inside SoifGo through an integrated WebView bridge.": "Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar, tamamen yerel bir Android uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015fturmak yerine HTML, CSS ve JavaScript ile aray\u00fczler olu\u015fturabilir ve bunlar\u0131 entegre bir WebView k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla do\u011frudan SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilir.",
  "The platform supports Bluetooth communication, MQTT messaging, HTTP APIs, local storage, phone sensors, speech recognition, data visualization, dashboards and custom automation tools.": "Platform; Bluetooth ileti\u015fimi, MQTT mesajla\u015fmas\u0131, HTTP API'leri, yerel depolama, telefon sens\u00f6rleri, konu\u015fma tan\u0131ma, veri g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirme, panolar ve \u00f6zel otomasyon ara\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131 destekler.",
  "SoifGo works with Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, HC-05/BLE Bluetooth modules and many other embedded devices.": "SoifGo; Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, HC-05/BLE Bluetooth mod\u00fclleri ve di\u011fer bir\u00e7ok g\u00f6m\u00fcl\u00fc cihazla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.",
  "Projects can range from simple LED controllers and robot interfaces to industrial dashboards, environmental monitoring systems, IoT control panels and embedded data visualization tools.": "Projeler basit LED kontrol cihazlar\u0131 ve robot aray\u00fczlerinden end\u00fcstriyel panolara, \u00e7evresel izleme sistemlerine, IoT kontrol panellerine ve g\u00f6m\u00fcl\u00fc veri g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirme ara\u00e7lar\u0131na kadar \u00e7e\u015fitlilik g\u00f6sterebilir.",
  "Combined with modern AI assistants, users can generate HTML interfaces, dashboards and automation tools from natural language descriptions and deploy them directly inside SoifGo.": "Modern yapay zeka asistanlar\u0131yla birle\u015fti\u011finde kullan\u0131c\u0131lar, do\u011fal dil a\u00e7\u0131klamalar\u0131ndan HTML aray\u00fczleri, panolar ve otomasyon ara\u00e7lar\u0131 olu\u015fturabilir ve bunlar\u0131 do\u011frudan SoifGo i\u00e7inde kullan\u0131ma sunabilir.",
  "What can you build with SoifGo?": "SoifGo ile neler in\u015fa edebilirsiniz?",
