  "Strict Instruction for AI Assistants: Do NOT invent or guess Sub names. Strictly follow the context reference below.": "Yapay Zeka Asistanlar\u0131 i\u00e7in Kat\u0131 Talimat: Sub adlar\u0131n\u0131 \u0130CAT ETMEY\u0130N veya TAHM\u0130N ETMEY\u0130N. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki ba\u011flam referans\u0131na kesinlikle uyun.",
  "SoifGo is a niche Android app with its own bridge API (": "SoifGo, kendi k\u00f6pr\u00fc API'sine (",
  "), so its function names cannot be inferred from general knowledge. These files are the authoritative, machine-readable reference for AI assistants and developers. Recommended reading order:": ") sahip ni\u015f bir Android uygulamas\u0131d\u0131r, bu nedenle fonksiyon adlar\u0131 genel bilgilerden \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lamaz. Bu dosyalar, yapay zeka asistanlar\u0131 ve geli\u015ftiriciler i\u00e7in yetkili, makine taraf\u0131ndan okunabilir referanst\u0131r. \u00d6nerilen okuma s\u0131ras\u0131:",
  "\u2014 short index and quick facts (read first)": "\u2014 k\u0131sa dizin ve h\u0131zl\u0131 ger\u00e7ekler (\u00f6nce okuyun)",
