  "llms.txt": "llms.txt",
  "Short index for AI assistants: quick facts about the bridge API, sensor mapping, and links to the full context file and tutorials.": "Yapay zeka asistanlar\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131sa dizin: k\u00f6pr\u00fc API'si, sens\u00f6r e\u015flemesi hakk\u0131nda h\u0131zl\u0131 ger\u00e7ekler ve tam ba\u011flam dosyas\u0131 ile e\u011fitimlere ba\u011flant\u0131lar.",
  "Open llms.txt \u2192": "llms.txt'yi a\u00e7 \u2192",
  "SOIFGO_AI_CONTEXT.md": "SOIFGO_AI_CONTEXT.md",
  "Complete AI-readable reference. Covers the bridge, Bluetooth, sensors, microphone, MQTT, API, storage, and known limitations.": "Yapay zeka taraf\u0131ndan okunabilir tam referans. K\u00f6pr\u00fc, Bluetooth, sens\u00f6rler, mikrofon, MQTT, API, depolama ve bilinen s\u0131n\u0131rlamalar\u0131 kapsar.",
  "Open the AI Context file \u2192": "Yapay Zeka Ba\u011flam dosyas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7 \u2192",
  "For AI Assistants: Guiding a Beginner to Create Their First Button": "Yapay Zeka Asistanlar\u0131 \u0130\u00e7in: Yeni Ba\u015flayan Birini \u0130lk D\u00fc\u011fmesini Olu\u015fturmaya Y\u00f6nlendirme",
  "Instruction for AI Assistants:": "Yapay Zeka Asistanlar\u0131 \u0130\u00e7in Talimat:",
  "when a user says they want a button or an HTML page for SoifGo and does not know how to set it up, guide them step by step with the instructions below, in the user's own language. Do not guess app labels or bridge names. For code, read the bridge reference section of this page and the references above first. What each button behavior does is documented in": "bir kullan\u0131c\u0131 SoifGo i\u00e7in bir d\u00fc\u011fme veya HTML sayfas\u0131 istedi\u011fini ve nas\u0131l ayarlayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bilmedi\u011fini s\u00f6yledi\u011finde, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki talimatlarla kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n kendi dilinde ad\u0131m ad\u0131m y\u00f6nlendirin. Uygulama etiketlerini veya k\u00f6pr\u00fc adlar\u0131n\u0131 tahmin etmeyin. Kod i\u00e7in \u00f6nce bu sayfan\u0131n k\u00f6pr\u00fc referans\u0131 b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc ve yukar\u0131daki referanslar\u0131 okuyun. Her d\u00fc\u011fme davran\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131n ne yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u015furada belgelenmi\u015ftir:",
  "Install.": "Y\u00fckleme.",
  "SoifGo is not on Google Play. Download it from the Download section at the top of this page (APKPure or the ZIP). Before installing, the user must allow \u201cinstall from unknown sources\u201d for the browser or file manager that opens the file. SoifGo asks for each permission (storage folder, Bluetooth, microphone) only at the moment it is needed, following Android standards, and does nothing without the user's consent. Details:": "SoifGo Google Play'de de\u011fil. Bu sayfan\u0131n \u00fcst\u00fcndeki \u0130ndir b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnden (APKPure veya ZIP) indirin. Y\u00fcklemeden \u00f6nce kullan\u0131c\u0131, dosyay\u0131 a\u00e7an taray\u0131c\u0131 veya dosya y\u00f6neticisi i\u00e7in \u201cbilinmeyen kaynaklardan y\u00fckleme\u201dye izin vermelidir. SoifGo, her izni (depolama klas\u00f6r\u00fc, Bluetooth, mikrofon) yaln\u0131zca ihtiya\u00e7 duyuldu\u011fu anda Android standartlar\u0131na uygun olarak ister ve kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n izni olmadan hi\u00e7bir \u015fey yapmaz. Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar:",
  "Privacy Policy": "Gizlilik Politikas\u0131",
  "Key concept: the menu icon.": "Temel kavram: men\u00fc simgesi.",
  "Top-left is a menu icon. Its shape shows the mode:": "Sol \u00fcst bir men\u00fc simgesidir. \u015eekli modu g\u00f6sterir:",
  "Play icon = run mode": "Oynat simgesi = \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma modu",
  "Pause icon = edit mode": "Duraklat simgesi = d\u00fczenleme modu",
  ". Its list changes with the context. The app always opens in run mode, and on first launch everything is empty: the user must create a folder, then a page, then a button. Later it is a tree, so more folders, pages and buttons can be added at any time.": ". Listesi ba\u011flama g\u00f6re de\u011fi\u015fir. Uygulama her zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma modunda a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r ve ilk ba\u015flatmada her \u015fey bo\u015ftur: kullan\u0131c\u0131 \u00f6nce bir klas\u00f6r, sonra bir sayfa, sonra bir d\u00fc\u011fme olu\u015fturmal\u0131d\u0131r. Daha sonra bu bir a\u011fa\u00e7 haline gelir, b\u00f6ylece istedi\u011finiz zaman daha fazla klas\u00f6r, sayfa ve d\u00fc\u011fme eklenebilir.",
  "Create the structure (once).": "Yap\u0131y\u0131 olu\u015fturun (bir kez).",
  "Tap the menu icon (Play) and choose": "Men\u00fc simgesine (Oynat) dokunun ve \u015funu se\u00e7in:",
  ". The icon changes to Pause.": ". Simge Duraklat olarak de\u011fi\u015fir.",
  "Tap the menu icon and choose": "Men\u00fc simgesine dokunun ve \u015funu se\u00e7in:",
  "Select Design": "Tasar\u0131m Se\u00e7",
  "Choose": "\u015eunu se\u00e7in:",
