  ", create it, optionally name it, confirm.": ", olu\u015fturun, iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak adland\u0131r\u0131n, onaylay\u0131n.",
  "Page": "Sayfa",
  "The list shows \u201cButton N\u201d and \u201cSeekBar N\u201d; N is the remaining count (40 buttons per page). Choose a button, then drag it on the screen to where you want it.": "Liste \u201cButton N\u201d ve \u201cSeekBar N\u201d g\u00f6sterir; N kalan say\u0131d\u0131r (sayfa ba\u015f\u0131na 40 d\u00fc\u011fme). Bir d\u00fc\u011fme se\u00e7in, ard\u0131ndan ekranda istedi\u011finiz yere s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin.",
  "Give the button a behavior.": "D\u00fc\u011fmeye bir davran\u0131\u015f verin.",
