  "to open the code editor (a notepad with syntax colors). No extra dialog appears. Paste the code you provided. Shortcut: the last item of the editor menu,": "kod d\u00fczenleyiciyi (s\u00f6zdizimi renkleri olan bir not defteri) a\u00e7mak i\u00e7in. Ekstra bir ileti\u015fim kutusu g\u00f6r\u00fcnmez. Sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z kodu yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. K\u0131sayol: d\u00fczenleyici men\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fcn son \u00f6\u011fesi,",
