  "= the WebView is in edit mode; tapping it saves, leaves the editor and returns to run mode right away, so the user sees the result. To change the code again, choose Edit again.": "= WebView d\u00fczenleme modundad\u0131r; dokunuldu\u011funda kaydeder, d\u00fczenleyiciden \u00e7\u0131kar ve hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma moduna d\u00f6ner, b\u00f6ylece kullan\u0131c\u0131 sonucu g\u00f6r\u00fcr. Kodu tekrar de\u011fi\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in tekrar D\u00fczenle'yi se\u00e7in.",
  "When you write the code.": "Kodu yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda.",
  "Give one complete HTML file (CSS and JavaScript inside) that the user can paste in one go. Never invent bridge names; for Bluetooth especially, read": "Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n tek seferde yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilece\u011fi eksiksiz bir HTML dosyas\u0131 (i\u00e7inde CSS ve JavaScript ile) verin. K\u00f6pr\u00fc adlar\u0131n\u0131 asla icat etmeyin; \u00f6zellikle Bluetooth i\u00e7in \u015funlar\u0131 okuyun:",
