  "3D file viewer showing a colored 3D surface with lighting, wireframe and grid controls, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "I\u015f\u0131kland\u0131rma, tel kafes ve \u0131zgara kontrolleri ile renkli bir 3D y\u00fczey g\u00f6steren, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturulan ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan 3D dosya g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleyici",
