  "Dashboard with voltage, current, power and energy gauges and a live waveform, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Gerilim, ak\u0131m, g\u00fc\u00e7 ve enerji g\u00f6stergeleri ve canl\u0131 bir dalga formu ile pano, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
