  "Temperature controller page with setpoint, relay status, live chart and control buttons, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Ayarlanan nokta, r\u00f6le durumu, canl\u0131 grafik ve kontrol d\u00fc\u011fmeleri ile s\u0131cakl\u0131k kontrol sayfas\u0131, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Industrial panel with tank levels, pump switches and valve controls, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Tank seviyeleri, pompa anahtarlar\u0131 ve valf kontrolleri ile end\u00fcstriyel panel, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Brick-breaker game with orange bricks, a ball and a paddle, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Turuncu tu\u011flalar, bir top ve bir raketle tu\u011fla k\u0131rma oyunu, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Stopwatch and countdown timer with start, stop and reset buttons, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Ba\u015flat, durdur ve s\u0131f\u0131rla d\u00fc\u011fmeleri ile kronometre ve geri say\u0131m sayac\u0131, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
