  "Scientific calculator with trigonometric, logarithm and square root keys, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Trigonometrik, logaritma ve karek\u00f6k tu\u015flar\u0131 ile bilimsel hesap makinesi, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Speed control page with direction buttons and two motor speed sliders, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Y\u00f6n d\u00fc\u011fmeleri ve iki motor h\u0131z\u0131 kayd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 ile h\u0131z kontrol sayfas\u0131, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Signal generator with wave type, frequency, volume and auto-stop settings, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Dalga t\u00fcr\u00fc, frekans, ses d\u00fczeyi ve otomatik durdurma ayarlar\u0131 ile sinyal \u00fcreteci, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor",
  "Screenshot 16: a page an AI assistant built from an idea, running in SoifGo": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 16: bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131n\u0131n bir fikirden olu\u015fturdu\u011fu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan bir sayfa",
  "Screenshot 17: a page an AI assistant built from an idea, running in SoifGo": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 17: bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131n\u0131n bir fikirden olu\u015fturdu\u011fu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan bir sayfa",
  "Screenshot 18: a page an AI assistant built from an idea, running in SoifGo": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 18: bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131n\u0131n bir fikirden olu\u015fturdu\u011fu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan bir sayfa",
  "Every screen here was built by an AI assistant from a plain-language idea and run inside SoifGo: a calculator, a stopwatch, a game, a 3D file viewer, a digital level, a signal generator, and control panels for robots, smart homes and factories.": "Buradaki her ekran, bir yapay zeka asistan\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sade bir dille yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir fikirden olu\u015fturuldu ve SoifGo i\u00e7inde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131: bir hesap makinesi, bir kronometre, bir oyun, bir 3D dosya g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleyici, bir dijital su terazisi, bir sinyal \u00fcreteci ve robotlar, ak\u0131ll\u0131 evler ve fabrikalar i\u00e7in kontrol panelleri."
